        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aztec Mythology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quetzal is a fast-paced, richly stylized indie card battle game that breathes new life into ancient Aztec mythology. Command the might of legendary gods, fearsome beasts, and arcane rituals in intense turn-based duels brimming with strategic depth and tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/856480b0a45b64ae3529383e0ca28343.poster.avif?t=1760096812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/856480b0a45b64ae3529383e0ca28343.webm?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/856480b0a45b64ae3529383e0ca28343.mp4?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Card Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique combat system where every turn matters. Build your deck, balance your resources, and unleash devastating combos as you fight to bring your opponent’s Life Points to zero. Make use of powerful Creatures, Spells and Counters to forge your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/b48ca9bb4179c136fb89e891e998d405.poster.avif?t=1760096812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/b48ca9bb4179c136fb89e891e998d405.webm?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/b48ca9bb4179c136fb89e891e998d405.mp4?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade. Expand. Conquer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your cards and grow your strength. Upgrade your base to unlock new features, earn valuable loot, and access new game modes as you rise through the ranks of a forgotten empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Anywhere, Anytime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quetzal can be played offline but also has online features that enhance the experience. Originally crafted for mobile and now refined for PC, Quetzal delivers smooth, optimized gameplay across platforms.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aztec Mythology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quetzal is a fast-paced, richly stylized indie card battle game that breathes new life into ancient Aztec mythology. Command the might of legendary gods, fearsome beasts, and arcane rituals in intense turn-based duels brimming with strategic depth and tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/856480b0a45b64ae3529383e0ca28343.poster.avif?t=1760096812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/856480b0a45b64ae3529383e0ca28343.webm?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/856480b0a45b64ae3529383e0ca28343.mp4?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Card Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique combat system where every turn matters. Build your deck, balance your resources, and unleash devastating combos as you fight to bring your opponent’s Life Points to zero. Make use of powerful Creatures, Spells and Counters to forge your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/b48ca9bb4179c136fb89e891e998d405.poster.avif?t=1760096812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/b48ca9bb4179c136fb89e891e998d405.webm?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685920/extras/b48ca9bb4179c136fb89e891e998d405.mp4?t=1760096812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade. Expand. Conquer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your cards and grow your strength. Upgrade your base to unlock new features, earn valuable loot, and access new game modes as you rise through the ranks of a forgotten empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Anywhere, Anytime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quetzal can be played offline but also has online features that enhance the experience. Originally crafted for mobile and now refined for PC, Quetzal delivers smooth, optimized gameplay across platforms.</p>",
